#ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">고급한국어</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">고급한국어</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기술경영</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">경영학과 전공</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강좌는 외국인 학생만 수강신청 가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 24</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일에 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년 교양선택 과목 타 학년이 수강신청 불가</span></u></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년 신입생이 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">24</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일에 수강신청할 수 없기 때문</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">~5</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일 수강변경기간에 신청가능</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">함</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 2015</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년도 신입생 수강신청은 교무처에서 일괄수강신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학사안내 공지사항 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">“2015</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년도 신입생 수강신청 관련사항 안내</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">” </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참조 : <strong>예정</strong></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공에 개설된 과목 중 강의시간</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">강의실 내역이 없는 강좌는 원격강좌임</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">□ </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 개시후 수강변경 및 수강정정으로 인한 수업 결손을 최소화 하고자 전체학년 수강신청 전에 일부 과목은 수강정원 조정 및 분반 추가개설</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설폐지 등 교과목 개설 내역이 변경될 수 있으니 확인 후 수강신청에 참고하시기 바람</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">(</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설교과목 조회 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학교홈페이지</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금오인</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-&gt;</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학사정보</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-&gt;</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개설과목안내</span></u></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">원스톱서비스 학부 개설과목 조회</span></u></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">□ </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수강신청인원 초과 및 강의실 멀티미디어 장비유무 등의 사유로 강의실이 변경되는 강좌가 있을 수도 있으니 수업 전에 확인 필요함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">□ </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 수강신청에 대한 자세한 사항은 학사안내 공지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">“2015</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학년도 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기 학부 수강신청 안내</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-